  m_Name: LS Camera To World Matrix
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_functionInfo: "// Made with Amplify Shader Editor v1.9.9.4\n// Available at the
    Unity Asset Store - http://u3d.as/y3X \n/*ASEBEGIN\nVersion=19904\nNode;AmplifyShaderEditor.CommentaryNode,
    AmplifyShaderEditor, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;19;-512,-800;Inherit;False;1242.655;533.7955;Camera
    To World Matrix Node;5;39;37;38;36;7;;0.03773582,0.03773582,0.03773582,1;0;0\nNode;AmplifyShaderEditor.StickyNoteNode,
    AmplifyShaderEditor, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;7;-464,-752;Inherit;False;627.028;145.225;;;0,0,0,1;The
    Camera To World Matrix node returns something in the likes of the inverse view
    matrix which can be used to transform a position or direction from View to World
    space.$$This is in the likes as for rendering, view space's forward is -z and
    camera matrices matches the script component's matrices(+z forward).;0;0\nNode;AmplifyShaderEditor.StickyNoteNode,
    AmplifyShaderEditor, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;36;-464,-592;Inherit;False;623;107;NOTE:;;0,0,0,1;We
    advise using either the Transform Position or Transform Direction as they are
    easier to use and you wont need to do an explicit multiplication between matrix
    and position/direction value.;0;0\nNode;AmplifyShaderEditor.StickyNoteNode, AmplifyShaderEditor,
    Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;38;-464,-464;Inherit;False;622;119;NOTE:;;0,0,0,1;This
    matrix for the time this documentation was created returned identity as it internally
    makes use of unity_CameraToWorld variable which isn't used by Unity's main rendering
    systems, only for post processing. For the current Inverse view Matrix you can
    use this, node.;0;0\nNode;AmplifyShaderEditor.CameraToWorldMatrix, AmplifyShaderEditor,
    Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;37;192,-752;Inherit;False;0;1;FLOAT4x4;0\nNode;AmplifyShaderEditor.StickyNoteNode,
    AmplifyShaderEditor, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;39;400,-752;Inherit;False;292.3799;100;Out;;0,0,0,1;unity_CameraToWorld$;0;0\nNode;AmplifyShaderEditor.FunctionOutput,
    AmplifyShaderEditor, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;0;-512,-896;Inherit;False;True;-1;Out;0;True;1;0;FLOAT;0;False;1;FLOAT;0\nASEEND*/\n//CHKSM=10E6C596E5C6CC85A1412028ED69DE68EF87ED6A"
